{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2024-12", "window": 2, "start_date": 1733616000, "end_date": 1734307199, "month_true_total": 196, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 22:00:55 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "182850637", "author": {"steamid": "76561197989468724", "personaname": "en_bell", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/en_bell/", "num_games_owned": 130, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 321, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 271, "last_played": 1734796152, "avatar": "ac6179ac63fcff3c91bd24d4a3791c505161549b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good gameplay, nice gunplay, and i like the graphics.", "timestamp_created": 1734299277, "timestamp_updated": 1734299277, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 12, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.584204673767089844", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182849102", "author": {"steamid": "76561198046378367", "personaname": "Aeriar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198046378367/", "num_games_owned": 40, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 4469, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4469, "last_played": 1734215033, "avatar": "28c7a96dc7108eae34c840f14c55235d6a3f6b25"}, "language": "english", "review": "I liked the game. It was not a masterpiece, but a decent game. The main story was interesting, I liked most of the companions, and I liked the environments, especially the Remnant architecture. Only some of the planets got a bit boring due to their size.", "timestamp_created": 1734297824, "timestamp_updated": 1734297824, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.592625975608825684", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182809405", "author": {"steamid": "76561198803681481", "personaname": "divinium", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/divinium86/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 47, "playtime_forever": 2103, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 834, "deck_playtime_at_review": 834, "last_played": 1734469558, "avatar": "9d3e3c339730f3037b83ae9b29ebb98b19931d48"}, "language": "english", "review": "I wish there was an “okay” option. Andromeda will always live in Shepard’s shadow and certainly isn’t as good as the original trilogy but the modern gameplay and planetary exploration the original lacked is great! \n\nThe MC isn’t nearly as bad as people make them out to be, pretty fitting for the role they‘re put in honestly.\n\nMain missions are fun imo, story is interesting even though it’s not as action packed and knees deep like the originals. It’s a lot of go here and go there, talk to this npc then come back kinda thing for the side missions (just like the original trilogy ironically)\n\nWhat I’m tryna say is, for a game that came out in the modern era of gaming you’d expect a bit more? They focused on quantity over quality basically and hopefully with Mass Effect 4 things turn around.", "timestamp_created": 1734264487, "timestamp_updated": 1734264487, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 27, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.694005012512207031", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "182797225", "author": {"steamid": "76561199543334397", "personaname": "sulfurguts", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sulfurguts/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 6548, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5569, "last_played": 1740534814, "avatar": "f4e8cf276110a89aa2c8b3db5154d98ab2102165"}, "language": "english", "review": "you can't even get the EA launcher to actually launch the game then if it does miraculously launch after trying repeatedly, you have to deal with \r\n- crashes and freezes constantly in cutscenes and loading screens\r\n-  so many bugs that either break quests or gameplay in certain instances entirely\r\n- poorly developed quest tracking and mapping in areas with multiple levels and spaces\r\n- even the mako was made worse in the form of the nomad which has no maneuverability (literally worse than ME1)\r\n\r\na shame since the OG ME games are amazing. the world design and graphics in this game can be beautiful, on the off chance it actually runs correctly. as a player, theres no reason i have to download multiple mods just to make the game halfway playable", "timestamp_created": 1734251621, "timestamp_updated": 1734251621, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 57, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.695291519165039062", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "182788976", "author": {"steamid": "76561198807737801", "personaname": "AlohaMahDude", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198807737801/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 92, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 92, "last_played": 1672626178, "avatar": "8b60357e6761032e9dec270044c9c22fd824dd0a"}, "language": "english", "review": "bad game", "timestamp_created": 1734241764, "timestamp_updated": 1734241764, "voted_up": fa